# Console screenshots embedded in README.md are LFS-tracked: the HuggingFace
# Space deploy path rejects a push containing non-LFS binaries.
#
# Scoped to this directory on purpose — a global `*.png` rule here would
# re-point every PNG blob in the repo (the Open Graph card in
# `web/public/og-wiwi.png`, for one) and force a history rewrite for files
# that are already committed. The deploy script runs `git lfs track "*.png"`
# in its own scratch clone, so the Space still stores every PNG as LFS.
docs/assets/shots/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
